{"rpid": "2280210", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "帕露茜", "mid": "209643", "level": 2, "vip": 0, "content": "P1歌词\n\nOpen your mind\nOpen your mind\n\nWhere the wind blows and where you can touch all the clouds, right above our earth\nThere we met and our path took its birth\nLittle, snow-white and gentle as feathers they are, swaying on with the wind\n\nCalling the stars at night, sending my wish on flight, &quot;Holding my love is my leading light&quot;\nI'm sure we'll make it through, just as the sky is blue\nI'm sure it's true, I'm sure I'll be with you\n\nOpen your mind\nOpen your mind\n\nOpen up your heart and show me love\n(Looking at my dreams far above)\nLetting my wish, follow the swaying wind, fly like a dove\n\n(Open your mind\nOpen your mind)\n\nWings cannot be seen just with the eye\n(But we both have them, you and I)\nLook in the sky, you have the wings to fly\n\nSo that you can be free\nYou can be free with me", "like": 1, "ctime": 1320680460, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "168572", "video_bvid": "BV17x411w7QL", "video_title": "〔英文翻唱二首〕我的女神1,2季OP", "video_desc": "填词和翻唱都真心不错~ 带字幕 油土伯搬运 -更多日漫歌曲英文翻唱：mylist10913 -让不会日语但喜欢这些曲子的人也能翻唱", "video_owner": "Parsee Mizuhashi", "video_view": 3067, "video_reply": 23, "video_n1": 19, "video_n2": 4}
